OL,3,CDiane Abbott readmitted to Labour
OL,4,CParty after 'formal warning'
OL,6,FDiane Abbott has been readmitted to
OL,7,Fthe Labour Party following an internal
OL,8,Finvestigation, the veteran MP has said.
OL,10,FMs Abbott was suspended from the party
OL,11,Fin July last year after repeating
OL,12,Fcomments about racism for which she
OL,13,Fhad previously apologised.
OL,15,FFellow Labour MP Joani Reid was also
OL,16,Freadmitted to the party on Thursday
OL,17,Fevening.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/10
