OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785457113
OL,3,CDiane Abbott readmitted to Labour
OL,4,CParty after 'formal warning'
OL,6,FShe had "voluntarily" suspended
OL,7,Fherself in March this year following
OL,8,Fthe arrest of her husband on suspicion
OL,9,Fof spying for China.
OL,11,FIn a statement on social media Ms
OL,12,FAbbott said she had been "issued with
OL,13,Fa formal warning" over a separate
OL,14,Ftweet in which she referred to the
OL,15,FIsrael Defence Force as the "Jewish
OL,16,FDefence Force".
OL,26,@nD@IOUnD@UO]tD@ZOUuD@QO]wD@]OUxD@NO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
