PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785457113
OL,3,CDiane Abbott readmitted to Labour
OL,4,CParty after 'formal warning'
OL,6,FApologising for the tweet, she said
OL,7,Fshe had "used wording that conflates
OL,8,Fthe actions of the state of Israel
OL,9,Fwith the Jewish community" and was
OL,10,F"deeply sorry for any hurt caused by
OL,11,Fthat conflation".
OL,13,FShe added: "I have been and remain a
OL,14,Flifelong anti-racist and remain deeply
OL,15,Fcommitted to opposing racism in all
OL,16,Fits forms."
OL,18,FThe year-long suspension was the
OL,19,Fsecond time Ms Abbott had had her
OL,20,FLabour membership suspended.
OL,26,@oD@IOUqD@ZO]rD@AOUsD@PO]uD@LOUxD@KO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/10
