OL,3,CDiane Abbott readmitted to Labour
OL,4,CParty after 'formal warning'
OL,6,FShe had previously been investigated
OL,7,Fby the party over a letter to the
OL,8,FObserver in 2023 in which she
OL,9,Fsuggested that Jewish, Irish and
OL,10,FTraveller people experience prejudice,
OL,11,Fbut not racism.
OL,13,FThe long-serving MP was subsequently
OL,14,Freadmitted to the party in time to
OL,15,Fcontest her Hackney North and Stoke
OL,16,FNewington seat at the 2024 general
OL,17,Felection.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
