OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785457113
OL,3,CDiane Abbott readmitted to Labour
OL,4,CParty after 'formal warning'
OL,6,FIn an interview with the BBC's
OL,7,FNewsnight, Phil Rosenberg, the
OL,8,Fpresident of the Board of Deputies of
OL,9,FBritish Jews, said he was "very sad
OL,10,Fand very concerned" by Ms Abbott's
OL,11,Freinstatement.
OL,13,FHe said: "I'm sad because in many
OL,14,Fways, Diane Abbott is an icon... the
OL,15,Flongest-serving female MP, the first
OL,16,Fblack female MP.
OL,26,@qD@[OUrD@SO]uD@JOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30206
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785457113
OL,3,CDiane Abbott readmitted to Labour
OL,4,CParty after 'formal warning'
OL,6,F"And so you'd hope that we would find
OL,7,Fcommon cause in fighting racism in all
OL,8,Fits different guises. But over and
OL,9,Fover again, she's making these
OL,10,Fstatements that are offensive to the
OL,11,FJewish community at a time when there
OL,12,Fis heightened anti-Semitism, deadly
OL,13,Fanti-Semitism as we saw at Heaton Park.
OL,15,F"Unfortunately Diane Abbott, over and
OL,16,Fover again, makes these comments and
OL,17,Fthen doubles down on them. And just
OL,18,Fonce again, she's apologised for the
OL,19,Fthing.
OL,26,@nD@AOUwD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
