PN,30207
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785457113
OL,3,CDiane Abbott readmitted to Labour
OL,4,CParty after 'formal warning'
OL,6,F"I'm just really sad and I'm concerned
OL,7,Fbecause, as you were implying, we've
OL,8,Fseen this movie before and it doesn't
OL,9,Fend well for the Jewish community and
OL,10,Fit does end well for Labour."
OL,12,FIn her own statement, East Kilbride
OL,13,Fand Strathaven MP Ms Reid said she was
OL,14,F"excited to play a full part in
OL,15,Fsupporting our new Prime Minister,
OL,16,FAndy Burnham, his Government, and in
OL,17,Frenewing Scottish Labour".
OL,26,@nD@AOUrD@]O]vD@AOUyD@YO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/10
