OL,3,CDiane Abbott readmitted to Labour
OL,4,CParty after 'formal warning'
OL,6,FShe added: "I have never been part of
OL,7,Fa police investigation, as a suspect
OL,8,For as a witness, and I am pleased that
OL,9,Fthis has now been recognised.
OL,11,F"The support I have received from
OL,12,Fcolleagues across the political
OL,13,Fspectrum, my constituents and my local
OL,14,FLabour Party has been steadfast.
OL,16,F"I am also deeply grateful to everyone
OL,17,Fwho has stood by me when it was
OL,18,Fpolitically easier to distance
OL,19,Fthemselves. You know who you are `
OL,20,Fthank you."
OL,26,@nD@LOUsD@AOUxD@AOU|D@KO]
