OL,3,CDiane Abbott readmitted to Labour
OL,4,CParty after 'formal warning'
OL,6,FHer voluntary suspension earlier this
OL,7,Fyear came after her husband, David
OL,8,FTaylor, was arrested along with two
OL,9,Fother men and accused of assisting a
OL,10,Fforeign intelligence service.
OL,12,FThe three men have since been released
OL,13,Fon police bail, which in May was
OL,14,Fextended until August.
OL,16,FThere is no suggestion of wrongdoing
OL,17,Fby Ms Reid.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
