OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785457113
OL,3,CDiane Abbott readmitted to Labour
OL,4,CParty after 'formal warning'
OL,6,FIt is understood that both
OL,7,Freadmissions followed formal Labour
OL,8,FParty processes and were not linked to
OL,9,FMr Burnham becoming party leader.
OL,11,FBoth Ms Abbott and Ms Reid have also
OL,12,Fhad the Labour whip restored after a
OL,13,Fperiod sitting as Independents.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/10
